1
00:00:00,640 --> 00:00:03,350
(Raj:)And when he got food poisoning
at the Rose Bowl parade...

2
00:00:03,518 --> 00:00:07,188
(Raj:)...he begged a deity he doesn't believe in
to end his life quickly.

3
00:00:08,481 --> 00:00:11,401
(Sheldon:)Do you understand
how important Hawking is to me?

4
00:00:11,567 --> 00:00:16,237
When I was 6 years old,
l dressed up as him for Halloween.

5
00:00:18,032 --> 00:00:19,822
- You're kidding.
- No, sir.

6
00:00:19,993 --> 00:00:23,453
(Sheldon:)No, I took my dad's desk chair,
attached a Speak & Spell to it...

7
00:00:23,621 --> 00:00:27,041
(Sheldon:)...and made my sister push me up
and down the block to trick-or-treat.

8
00:00:28,960 --> 00:00:33,340
(Sheldon:)Granted, most people thought I was
R2-D2, but still, I got a lot of candy.

9
00:00:33,506 --> 00:00:36,926
(Howard:)You don't seem to be understanding
the English word "no."

10
00:00:37,093 --> 00:00:39,053
(Howard:)Maybe a different language will help.

11
00:00:39,220 --> 00:00:46,060
Russian: Nyet. Chinese: bú.
Japanese: iie. Klingon: qo'.

12
00:00:46,227 --> 00:00:51,067
Binary coded ASCll:
0110111001101111.

13
00:00:53,818 --> 00:00:57,318
